<h2>Broken links in every application</h2>

<p>Each literal link in each template, checked the way <code>$padCheckOutput</code> checks a rendered page.</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="4">

  {brokenLinks}
    <tr><td>{$file}</td><td>{$broken}</td></tr>
  @else@
    <tr><td>No broken links.</td></tr>
  {/brokenLinks}

</table>
